# GD-23 (round 19, writer 10): L §8.4 LOAD-UNIT "an order (<, <=, >, >=, min, max, sort) on texts, codes or
# month-days"; text compares only by == and !=.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons
index oi: open
input x[k in oi]: int
input t1: text
def d: bool = t1 < t1

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  x[k1] = 1
  t1 = "a"
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT text is ordered by nothing; only == and != compare it (m.tally:13)
